<html xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" xmlns:w="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><style>@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@400;600;700&display=swap');
  body{font-family:'Nunito','ABC Arizona Sans',Calibri,sans-serif;color:#23303f;font-size:11pt;margin:0}
  .hdr{background:#16263f;color:#fff;padding:18px 28px}
  .brand{font-family:'ABC Arizona','Nunito',Georgia,serif;font-size:21pt;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.4px}
  .hsub{color:#9fb2cd;font-size:10pt;margin-top:3px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px}
  .accent{height:4px;background:#2bb3a3}
  .wrap{padding:24px 30px}
  h1{font-family:'ABC Arizona','Nunito',Georgia,serif;color:#16263f;font-size:18pt;margin:0 0 2px}
  h2{font-family:'ABC Arizona','Nunito',Georgia,serif;color:#16263f;font-size:13pt;border-bottom:1.5px solid #2bb3a3;padding-bottom:3px;margin:18px 0 6px}
  p{margin:2px 0}.sub{color:#5a6675;font-size:10pt}.lbl{font-weight:700;color:#127a7a;margin-top:7px}.bul{margin-left:20px}.ind{margin-left:14px}
 </style></head><body><div class="hdr"><div class="brand">MyWealth Solutions</div><div class="hsub">Advice Request</div></div><div class="accent"></div><div class="wrap"><h1>Advice Request – David &amp; Lisa Hartmann</h1><p class="sub">Adviser: Hayden Wilson</p><p class="sub">(ACCUMULATOR SOA · Couple · Existing client)</p><div style="height:7px"></div><p>Hi Team,</p><p>David &amp; Lisa are existing clients. They want to retain their SMSF and establish an investment portfolio in the SMSF name, cancel personal insurances, consolidate the car loan into the home loan, and switch the investment property loan to interest only.</p><div style="height:7px"></div><div style="height:7px"></div><h2>Risk Profile</h2><div style="height:7px"></div><h2>Scope of Advice</h2><p>1 · Debt Management</p><p>2 · Investment Property</p><p>3 · Investment Bond</p><p>4 · Investment Plan</p><p>5 · Personal Superannuation</p><p>6 · Superannuation Contributions</p><p>7 · Personal Protection</p><p>8 · Cashflow Management &amp; Budgeting</p><div style="height:7px"></div><h2>1 · Debt Management Advice</h2><p class="lbl">Strategy Recommendations</p><p class="bul">• Joint: We recommend consolidating your existing car loan into your home loan.</p><p class="bul">• Joint: We recommend you switch your investment property loan(s) from principal &amp; interest to interest only to improve cashflow and maintain tax-deductible debt.</p><div style="height:7px"></div><h2>7 · Personal Protection Advice</h2><p class="lbl">Strategy Recommendations</p><p class="bul">• Joint: We recommend you cancel your existing of $XXX as it exceeds your current insurance needs.</p><div style="height:7px"></div><h2>CARE Investment Philosophy — why recommended (feeds Outcomes / Super &amp; Investment / Alternatives / Replacement Implications)</h2><p class="bul">• [Both] Active, professional day-to-day management (dynamic asset allocation)</p><div style="height:7px"></div><h2>Advice Fees — Remuneration</h2></div></body></html>